    Seed one signed act, submit the unchanged full chain, and require the original prefix to replay while only the missing suffix lands. Check exact typed outcomes, event identities, provenance and depth, then replay the completed chain without changing head or depth. Keep the prior preflight/full-replay control under an accurate name.
    
